{"nodes": [{"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_references_add_watch_add_watch_reference", "label": "Referencia: /graphify add y --watch", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/references/add-watch.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ninguno de los dos forma parte del build por defecto."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_references_add_watch_graphify_add", "label": "/graphify add \u2014 ingesta de una URL", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/references/add-watch.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Detecta el tipo de URL autom\u00e1ticamente (YouTube a transcripci\u00f3n, Twitter/X v\u00eda oEmbed, arXiv a metadatos, PDF, im\u00e1genes, cualquier web a markdown) y despu\u00e9s ejecuta --update sobre ./raw."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_references_add_watch_graphify_watch", "label": "--watch \u2014 vigilancia de la carpeta", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/references/add-watch.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cambios de c\u00f3digo re-ejecutan AST + rebuild + cluster sin LLM; cambios en docs/papers/im\u00e1genes solo dejan una bandera needs_update porque requieren re-extracci\u00f3n sem\u00e1ntica."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_references_add_watch_debounce", "label": "Debounce del watcher", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/skills/graphify/references/add-watch.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Espera a que pare la actividad de archivos (3s por defecto) para que una oleada de escrituras paralelas de agentes no dispare un rebuild por archivo."}, {"id": "_claude_skills_graphify_references_add_watch_agentic_workflow",